                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "show_for": [
                        "priority_health"
                    ],
                    "string": "To schedule your comprehensive medication review call 616.303.1014",
                    "text_style": {
                        "fontSize": 12.0,
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "show_for": [
                        "aloha"
                    ],
                    "string": "To schedule your comprehensive medication review call <b>1-808-973-7418</b>.",
                    "text_style": {
                        "fontSize": 12.0,
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "show_for": [
                        "medigold"
                    ],
                    "string": "To schedule your comprehensive medication review call 1-866-575-3199",
                    "text_style": {
                        "fontSize": 12.0,
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "show_for": [
                        "icare"
                    ],
                    "string": "To schedule your comprehensive medication review call {hotline_phone}",
                    "text_style": {
                        "fontSize": 12.0,
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "list": {
                    "hide_for": [
                        "priority_health",
                        "aloha",
                        "medigold",
                        "icare"
                    ],
                    "items": [
                        "<b>To schedule your pharmacist\u2019s review or to opt out of this program, call us within 30 days</b> at 1-800-424-4216 or TTY:1-800-662-1220, Monday through Friday from 8:30 a.m. to 4:30 p.m. EST."
                    ],
                    "list_attributes": {
                        "bulletType": "bullet",
                        "spaceAfter": 8.0
                    },
                    "list_item_attributes": {
                        "spaceAfter": 2.0,
                        "spaceBefore": 2.0
                    },
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "hide_for": [
                        "priority_health",
                        "aloha",
                        "medigold",
                        "icare"
                    ],
                    "string": "Please note, sometimes our return phone number begins with area code (401) instead of our 800-number on your caller ID. Please pick up when you see this number, or just call us today to reserve your appointment spot for a pharmacist\u2019s review! <br/><br/>We look forward to helping you live a healthier life.<br/><br/>Warm Regards,<br/>Your Medicare Pharmacy Management Team",
                    "text_style": {
                        "fontSize": 12.0,
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "show_for": [
                        "priority_health",
                        "icare"
                    ],
                    "string": "<font size = 13><b>Don\u2019t want to participate?</b></font><br/><br/> Participation is optional. If you do not wish to participate, call Customer Service toll-free at 888.389.6648 (TTY users should call 711), seven days a week from 8 a.m. to 8 p.m. Or complete and return the attached form, and we will remove you from the program. You may continue to receive calls throughout the year until a formal request has been processed. If you remain a Priority Health Medicare member, you can rejoin the program at any time. You may be offered MTM services again next year if you continue to qualify for the program.<br/><br/> We look forward to helping you live a healthier life. <br/><br/>Sincerely,<br/><br/> Jacob Chaffee, PharmD <br/>Director of Pharmacy",
                    "string_replacements": {
                        "icare": {
                            "English": "<font size = 13><b>Don\u2019t want to participate?</b></font><br/><br/> Participation is optional. If you do not wish to participate, call Customer Service toll-free at {hotline_phone} (TTY users should call 711), seven days a week from 9:00 a.m. CST to 7:00 p.m. CST, Monday through Sunday. You may continue to receive calls throughout the year until a formal request has been processed. If you remain an <i>i</i>Care Medicare member, you can rejoin the program at any time. You may be offered MTM services again next year if you continue to qualify for the program.<br/><br/> We look forward to helping you live a healthier life. <br/><br/>Sincerely,<br/><br/> <i>i</i>Care"
                        }
                    },
                    "text_style": {
                        "fontSize": 12.0,
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "show_for": [
                        "aloha"
                    ],
                    "string": "Participation is optional. If you do not wish to participate, call AlohaCare Pharmacy at <b>1-808-973-7418, TTY/TDD 1-877-447-5990)</b>, Monday through Friday from 8 AM to 5 PM Hawaii Time.You may continue to receive calls throughout the year until a formal request has beenprocessed. If you remain a AlohaCare Medicare member, you can rejoin the program at anytime. You may be offered MTM services again next year if you continue to qualify for the program.<br/><br/>We look forward to helping you live a healthier life.<br/>Sincerely,<br/><br/>{hotline_name}",
                    "text_style": {
                        "fontSize": 12.0,
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "show_for": [
                        "medigold"
                    ],
                    "string": "<font size = 13><b>Don\u2019t want to participate?</b></font><br/><br/> Participation is optional. If you do not wish to participate, call Customer Service toll-free at 1-866-575-3199 (TTY users should call 711), from 8:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m. EST, Monday through Friday. You may continue to receive calls throughout the year until a formal request has been processed. If you remain a {hotline_name} Medicare member, you can rejoin the program at any time. You may be offered MTM services again next year if you continue to qualify for the program<br/><br/> We look forward to helping you live a healthier life. <br/><br/>Sincerely,<br/><br/> {hotline_name}",
                    "text_style": {
                        "fontSize": 12.0,
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            }
